<ol class="chain">
  <li><b>Keyboard</b><span>A small Bluetooth MIDI keyboard, no cable. The one in the video matches CME's Xkey Air.</span></li>
  <li><b>Behringer Pro-800</b><span>An eight-voice reproduction of the Sequential Prophet-600 from 1982.</span></li>
  <li><b>Chorus</b><span>To widen the sound, as on the 1983 record.</span></li>
  <li><b>Delay</b><span>To repeat it. At the end it repeats the short chords.</span></li>
</ol>
